{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果首款摺疊屏手機iPhone Duo於2026年10月23日正式進入上市交付階段，首批預購用户開始收到新機，蘋果零售店也迎來首發日消費者。由於預購需求強勁，加上生產供應受到限制，上市初期的現貨數量相當有限，部分消費者即使在首發日下單，也可能需要等待數月才能拿到設備。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583562.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:42.756512+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:32:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.861481+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.861481+00:00","content_hash":"22ef65899eba5dc23e474d29f6881bdf25403e37555565085b2af6237f16245e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}